OL,3,GNEWSAMaoliosa McHugh stepping down as
OL,4,AWest Tyrone MLA
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaoliosa McHugh has announced he will
OL,7,Fbe stepping down as MLA for West Tyrone
OL,8,Ffrom Tuesday.
OL,10,FEarlier this year, the Sinn Fein MLA
OL,11,Fsaid he would not be seeking
OL,12,Fre-election to Stormont in May 2017.
OL,14,FHe said, as he was not seeking
OL,15,Fre-election, he had decided to step
OL,16,Fdown on 1 September "prior to the
OL,17,Fcommencement of the final term of the
OL,18,FAssembly".
OL,20,FMcHugh has been a representative for
OL,21,Fthe West Tyrone constituency at the
OL,22,FNorthern Ireland Assembly since 2019.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
